## Original Content
Más de un centenar de bomberos trabajan para controlar las llamas, que avanzan por un cerro en dirección a Sant Cugat.

## Summary
A fire in Collserola has forced the evacuation of homes in a neighborhood of Barcelona and confined 14,000 people. Over a hundred firefighters are working to control the flames advancing towards Sant Cugat.

## Key Points
- Fire occurred in the Collserola area.
- Evacuation of homes in a Barcelona neighborhood.
- 14,000 people confined due to the fire.
- More than 100 firefighters are involved in controlling the flames.
- Flames are advancing towards Sant Cugat.


